 # NOMROM for Windows
 
 This is the Windows port in progress, based on NOMROM for Mac 1.7.7, with
-project version 1.11.1+30. Preserve the Mac edition's functionality while giving
+project version 1.11.3+32. Preserve the Mac edition's functionality while giving
 Windows five fresh, minimal themes: **Clarity**, **Dusk**, **Graphite**,
 **Linen** and **Studio**. Clarity is the default. The caption and window controls
 are integrated into the app's theme, without a separate native titlebar.
@@ -27,6 +27,15 @@ the chosen provider through retries, and repairs Windows torrent startup and
 file selection. Earlier verified TorBox matching, selective ZIP retrieval,
 and Skraper integration are retained alongside the newer Windows engine.
 
+Version 1.11.2 repairs Internet Archive email/password sign-in, complete-session
+validation, public-link access and the distinction between service, login and
+item-permission failures.
+
+Version 1.11.3 adds staged torrent destination replacement, pause/cancel guards
+during finalization, and extraction receipts so unrelated same-name files or
+folders cannot make an archive appear already extracted. This is a review
+candidate; test and build results are recorded separately before publication.
+
 ScreenScraper activation is approved for this release. Run
 `Build-NOMROM-ScreenScraper.cmd` to enter the issued developer access through
 hidden local prompts, check application access, and build with ScreenScraper
